      "title": "Qwen Image 2.1 INT8 (convrot) — notes",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "Qwen-Image 2.1 INT8 convrot weights, quantized and published by Comfy-Org (Comfy-Org/Qwen-Image-2.1). Loaded natively by ComfyUI >= 0.37.0; no GGUF or custom nodes.\n\nUNETLoader: qwen_image_2.1_int8_convrot.safetensors, weight_dtype=default (ComfyUI selects the compute dtype for the GPU). CLIPLoader: qwen3vl_8b_int8_convrot.safetensors, type=qwen_image, device=cpu. VAE: qwen_image_2.1_vae_bf16.safetensors (BF16, unchanged).\n\nINT8 stores the transformer and text encoder at roughly half the size of BF16. Ceres reserves 5 GiB of VRAM for FP32 casts and attention scratch; the text encoder runs on the CPU.\n\nDefault generation: 1024x1024, seed 42 fixed, 25 steps, cfg 1, euler/simple."
      ]
    }
